{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>According to all that you asked, etc.</b> Perhaps it comes to say that they brought it upon themselves that not all of them are prophets, for as they said on the day of assembly: ״קְרַב אַתָּה וּשְׁמַע,״ and they were frightened by the minor concomitant effect of prophecy. Therefore HaShem likewise gives them a prophet, and whoever needs to speak to Him may come and tell it to him, and for this reason Scripture says all that is stated on the matter."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:18:01.607009540Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}